# Always Rebuild After Changes

When you edit source files under `src/` (or any code that affects the rever-imgui target), **always run a build afterward** so the user gets an up-to-date binary.

**Build command:**
```bash
cd build && make rever-imgui
```

Run this after edits to:
- `src/**/*.cpp`, `src/**/*.hpp`, `src/**/*.mm`
- `CMakeLists.txt` or other build config that affects rever-imgui

Do not skip the build step; the user expects a rebuild after every change.
